---
import DefaultLayout from "$lib/layouts/default.astro";
import IRacingNavigation from "$lib/components/iracing-navigation.astro";
---

<DefaultLayout title="Jacob Collins' Stat 'N' Track" description="Information regarding the Stat 'N' Track iRacing statistics viewer developed by Jacob Collins">
  <div
    class="h-screen w-screen bg-gray-900 text-white text-center font-sans grid lg:grid-cols-4"
  >
    <div class="col-span-1 bg-gray-900"></div>
    <div class="col-span-2 pt-20 px-4 bg-gray-900">
      <h1 class="text-7xl mb-2">Stat 'N' Track</h1>
      <IRacingNavigation />
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg my-3">
        Stat 'N' Track is a website built for being able to browse iRacing
        driver stats per driver for official series including filters for: all
        race sessions, race sessions by year, race sessions by car class, race
        sessions by track, all season standings, season standings in which a
        driver fully participated, season standings by year, season standings by
        car class and head to head matchups against other driver(s) listed on
        the site. My version of the site can be found <a
          class="text-blue-400"
          href="https://shinsina.github.io/Stat-N-Track/"
          target="_blank">here</a
        >.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg my-3">
        Currently Stat 'N' Track is available per request in which the site
        files will be provided via a zip folder for all driver(s) requested to
        be included for the site. If you would like Stat 'N' Track for you and
        your team/friends, feel free to reach out over Discord.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg my-3">
        If you'd like to take a crack at building out a site for yourself
        instructions for both the scripts to pull the data from iRacing
        alongside generating the site can be found on GitHub:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li class="list-inside list-disc">
          <a
            class="text-blue-400"
            href="https://github.com/Shinsina/iRacing-API-Scripts"
            target="_blank">Scripts</a>
        </li>
        <li class="list-inside list-disc">
          <a
            class="text-blue-400"
            href="https://github.com/Shinsina/Stat-N-Track"
            target="_blank">Site</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 bg-gray-900 py-4"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-span-1 bg-gray-900"></div>
  </div>
</DefaultLayout>
